WEBVTT

00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:05.754
Academic calendar

00:00:05.804 --> 00:00:09.248
Open Management, then Academic Calendar.

00:00:13.322 --> 00:00:18.761
Use the month selectors to move around. Sundays are off automatically.

00:00:23.012 --> 00:00:25.301
Press Add Event or Off Day.

00:00:26.571 --> 00:00:32.705
Enter a title, choose OFF Day, pick a category, and set the start and end date.

00:00:46.273 --> 00:00:50.417
Press Save. The off day appears on the calendar.

00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:59.613
The calendar is up to date
